"[HEADER] Launch Infos",
"kill",
"Only do this if 'launch-ds3.bat' closes instantly after booting it up:\n\nOpen a 'Command Prompt' AS ADMIN from your Windows search bar. Then, open your DS3 installation directory and copy the full path to the 'DS3-Archipelago' folder inside the DS3 Steam folder (should be something like 'C:\\program files (x86)\\steam\\steamapps\\common\\DARK SOULS III\\DS3-Archipelago'. After copying it, go back to the Command Prompt and type 'cd' followed by the path that you just copied. Finally, enter 'launch-ds3.bat' and press enter!",
"kill",
"[HEADER] Connection Infos",
"kill",
"IF LAUNCH-DS3.BAT DOESN'T OPEN FOR YOU, FOLLOW THE 'Launch Infos' INSTRUCTIONS TO OPEN IT!\n\n\Once everything is set up, open the DS3-Archipelago folder inside you game's folder. First, you'll need to run 'DS3Randomizer.exe' (inside 'randomizer').\n\nIn the 'Room URL' field, enter archipelago.gg: followed by the port, this is a 5-digit number that you can find on the website after creating a new room.\n\nIn 'Player name', enter the name assigned to your YAML file.\n\nThe 'Password' field is optional. If the host did not set one, leave it blank.\n\nFinally, press 'Load' and you can go to the next step.\n\nMake sure you aren't offline on Steam, and start 'launch-ds3.bat'.\n\n/!\\ MAKE SURE THAT YOU ARE OFFLINE ON DARK SOULS 3 BEFORE STARTING /!\\",
"kill",
"[HEADER] Revert Infos",
